    <title>Downshift lines, char 20: 8&gt;7</title>
    <description>@0x1ddcbe (file +0x5dabe). Output-shaft speed (rpm) at which the downshift is requested, over accelerator pedal (per mille, 1100 = kickdown). 8000 = shift disabled. Rows = pedal breakpoints (live axis @0x1cc44c), columns = gear pairs. Each slot is 15 u16 (30 B); the up and down slots of one gear pair alternate (down = up + 30 B). Slot addresses @0x1d1740; gear 8&gt;7..8&gt;7. Characteristic 20 of 23, selected from the strategy state. Geometry verified in the image (pointer tables 0x5A47C/0x5A984). Confidence HIGH for the layout, MED for which characteristic is which. || E84 8609556: native slot (21 chars, memory order; axis pairing positional LOW; 8200 = disabled). Values are E84 stock.</description>
